# wear/man/wrap_hang: the wrap's long skirt (a sarong) to the ankles, its wrapped edge falling as a lit line from the waist
# to the hem, a solid lit hem; it sways by whole rows and spreads over the striding legs
# GARB-M (P2b wave 2); fitted to the man (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role garment wrap
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
z 10
# (z 10: over the shoe tips (legs/adult/loco/tips, z 9), so a foot lifted behind the hem stays under it)
sway 4
# (an elf stands a pixel taller in the legs: each view's stretch row doubles, so the hem still meets the shoes)

